-- title:
--   Maximal ideal of a power series ring over a local ring
-- statement:
--   Let $\sigma$ be a finite type and $R$ a commutative ring which is local, with maximal ideal $\mathfrak m_R$. Inside the ring $\mathrm{MvPowerSeries}\ \sigma\ R$ of formal power series in the variables $X_i$, $i \in \sigma$, with coefficients in $R$ (itself local, so that its maximal ideal is defined), the assertion is the equality of ideals $$\mathfrak m_{R[[X_i : i \in \sigma]]} = \mathfrak m_R \cdot R[[X_i : i \in \sigma]] + (X_i : i \in \sigma),$$ where the first summand is the image ideal `(IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal R).map MvPowerSeries.C`, i.e. the ideal generated by the constant power series $C(a)$ with $a \in \mathfrak m_R$, the second summand is the ideal spanned by the set of all variables `MvPowerSeries.X i`, and the sum is the join of the two ideals in the lattice of ideals. Finiteness of $\sigma$ is essential for the inclusion from left to right: with infinitely many variables, $\sum_i X_i$ has vanishing constant term but does not lie in the ideal generated by the variables.
--
--   This is the standard identification of the maximal ideal of a formal power series ring over a local ring, and with it of the cotangent data of $\mathcal O[[X_1,\dots,X_n]]$. It is used in the treatment of Cohen-type presentations $\mathcal O[[X_1,\dots,X_n]] \twoheadrightarrow A$ of complete Noetherian local $\mathcal O$-algebras, and is cited here by [`MvPowerSeries.exists_coords_of_quotient_span_finite_free`](thm.html#MvPowerSeries.exists_coords_of_quotient_span_finite_free).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_MvPowerSeries_maximalIdeal_eq_map_C_sup_span_X.lean

import Mathlib.RingTheory.MvPowerSeries.Inverse
import Mathlib.RingTheory.AdicCompletion.Noetherian

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

universe u v w

theorem MvPowerSeries.maximalIdeal_eq_map_C_sup_span_X {σ : Type u} {R : Type v} [Finite σ] [CommRing R] [IsLocalRing R] : IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal (MvPowerSeries σ R) = (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal R).map (MvPowerSeries.C (σ := σ) (R := R)) ⊔ Ideal.span (Set.range (MvPowerSeries.X : σ → MvPowerSeries σ R)) := by sorry
